{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ff01393d-34d7-884c-9d90-3f7243aaa726",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T15:35:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nilza Tavares",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:31:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good afternoon! How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:31:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. Um, my name is Nilza Tavares. I am calling about a class, a class that was cancelled. I would like to have my money back, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:31:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. Which class was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:03-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the Saturday swimming for children, the beginners. I paid in January, and then they send me a message, the class is cancelled. Because of the, how you say, the pool, the pool has a problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the beginner swim session. Got it. And how did you pay for it, was that in person or did you register over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In person. I went to the office and I pay with the card. My daughter, she is the one who is registered. Her name is Tavares also, Ana."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, let me look her up. Can you spell the first name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A, N, A. Ana Tavares."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:47-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one moment while I pull that up. [pause] Yep, I see her. Beginner swim, Saturday mornings, and it shows as cancelled on our end. So you're all set to be refunded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:32:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, good. And, um, can I ask how much it was? I do not remember the cost exactly. I want to be sure it is the same on the refund."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It shows you paid sixty dollars for the session. That's what will go back on the card."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sixty. Yes, yes, that is right. How long it takes, to come back to the card?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few business days once we process it, sometimes a little longer depending on your bank. I'll put it through today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that is good. Thank you. I must tell you, last time I called here, they put me on hold, a long time, and I hang up. Today you answer, and no waiting. I am very surprised, in a good way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad we caught you at a good time. Afternoons are a little quieter. Sorry about the last call, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it is okay. Today is very nice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want me to take a phone number, in case there's any problem with the refund?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is four, zero, one, five, five, five, zero, one, seven, three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-three. Got it. I've got the refund request noted on Ana's registration."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And, um, the next session of the swimming, when they start again? I do not know if it is open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have a firm date for the pool to reopen. I can put your name down to get a call when the next session opens up. Would that work?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be good. Please put the name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. You'll hear from us when we have dates. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you very much, Beth. You have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T15:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Nilza. Take care, bye now!"
    }
  ],
